*3 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 19.33~20 seconds<sup>580f~600f</sup>.
*3 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 11.33 seconds<sup>340f</sup>, delay 19.33~20 seconds<sup>580f~600f</sup>.
*3 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 19.33~20 seconds<sup>580f~600f</sup>.
*5 [[Haterbaa 2.0]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
