**5 [[Zuche]]s spawn, delay 10~15 seconds<sup>300f~450f</sup>.
**1 [[Sister Lione]] spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This stage lacks pressure outside of the [[Zombie Enemies]], as while the Thrillerz can easily interrupt the flow of [[:Category:Meatshield-class Cats|meatshields]] and the Zuche can cripple backliners, both of the [[Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] act as HP walls due to their low attack, allowing them to be mostly ignored as they are worn down by the leftovers of your anti-Zombie offense, or rushed down anyway if the Zombies are not enough of an impediment

While Metals and Darks are traits that are normally designed around forcing you to bring specific counters to them, here the Haterbaas spawn infrequently and have low enough HP that even normal meatshields can do the job of Critters, and the Doge Darks have low magnifications for this point of the game, and so primarily serve as a source of money. Both spawn in limited numbers, so if they are still a problem in combination with the boss wave, they can be farmed at the start to both exhaust them and build up money.

